{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"801","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Vicious Keyboard"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Tonio has a keyboard with only two letters, \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"K"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"One day, he has typed out a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" with only these two letters. He really likes it when the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" appears, so he wishes to change at most one letter in the string (or do no changes) to maximize the number of occurrences of that string. Compute the maximum number of times \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" can appear as a substring (i. e. a letter \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"K"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" right after a letter \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\") in the resulting string."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line will contain a string "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s"},{"kind":"text","text":" consisting only of uppercase English letters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"K"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" with length not less than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and not greater than "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"100"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single integer, the maximum number of times \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" can appear as a substring of the given string after changing at most one character."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VK\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VV\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"V\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"VKKKKKKKKKVVVVVVVVVK\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"3\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"KVKV\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the first case, we do not change any letters. \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" appears once, which is the maximum number of times it could appear."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second case, we can change the second character from a \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to a \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"K"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". This will give us the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". This has one occurrence of the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a substring."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the fourth case, we can change the fourth character from a \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"K"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" to a \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"V"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". This will give us the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VKKVKKKKKKVVVVVVVVVK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\". This has three occurrences of the string \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"VK"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" as a substring. We can check no other moves can give us strictly more occurrences."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"801A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/801/problem/A"}